        <source>Well ::she shrugs:: I ... I have nothing better to do. We've found out this place some time ago and figured out we could settle in here. On the initial voyage, it was Zack and I who have arrived here at first, while the rest came after several more trips. Things were working out well; especially due to the mushrooms that were quite easy to grow here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
